# Title: Usage Of Web Request Commands And Cmdlets
# ID: 9fc51a3c-81b3-4fa7-b35f-7c02cf10fd2d
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: James Pemberton / @4A616D6573, Endgame, JHasenbusch, oscd.community, Austin Songer @austinsonger
# Date: 2019-10-24
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects the use of various web request commands with commandline tools and Windows PowerShell cmdlets (including aliases) via CommandLine
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine CONTAIN "[System.Net.WebRequest]::create" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "curl " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Invoke-RestMethod" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Invoke-WebRequest" OR CommandLine CONTAIN " irm " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "iwr " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Resume-BitsTransfer" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Start-BitsTransfer" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "wget " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "WinHttp.WinHttpRequest"))
